orthant 2 patch

@ 1 0 0 187bff8da2f7d6850eba0b8b8e7fffbf
+       // A singleton's underlying type may carry a capture set: under capture checking,
+       // `Setup` gives a module class a self type with one, so `this` of an object is
+       // `C.type^{'s}`, not `C.type`. It does not change which value the singleton is, so
+       // it is stripped; otherwise an atom found while capture checking keeps a prefix
+       // that one found while typing (as the cached atoms of a union were) normalized away.

@ 0 1 0 0d5dda7320fb577f1bf52096c8ba4b61
+           tp.underlying.dealias.stripCapturing match
